											},
											"tail": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_6d9fa8d056e94d47a0aa388990a8651f"
											},
											"points": "470:2598;120:2598",
											"nameLabel": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_8a8b9cdbf8154e7ab94a176d5e95b5c7"
											},
											"stereotypeLabel": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_c362193e33ac432bb787a9745f979d0a"
											},
											"propertyLabel": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_02ebb503c2684614a941e880990baa97"
											},
											"activation": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_9039c0a8a9924ec2a1f30318645b73ef"
											},
											"showProperty": false,
											"showType": false
										},
										{
											"_type": "UMLTextView",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_85ba988b96ae43928005fb57990dda58",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_4ecba0bb183147fea9a234c8bf65e257"
											},
											"left": 20,
											"top": 2722,
											"width": 2720,
											"height": 122,
											"text": "Preparation/validation failure or missing/mismatched server context: no new save; correct input (integer quantity >= 1) or reload a missing item.\nSame-submission retry: skip PrepareStockReceipt; retain requestKey, souvenirId, quantity and original receivedAt.\nExisting receipt: requestMatches=true reuses its saved outcome; false returns request conflict without exposing receipt or changing stock.\nConfirmed rollback: return storage failure. Unknown outcome: recheck the same key with MatchesRequest; a miss/error stays unknown. No new key or blind save.\nStock refresh failure after receipt confirmation: keep receipt success, currentSouvenir absent and stockRefreshSucceeded=false; reload stock. Lookup failure is not zero stock.",
											"font": "Arial;14;0",
											"parentStyle": false,
											"showShadow": false
										}
									],
									"showSequenceNumber": false,
									"documentation": "UC8 main new-submission flow at the same overview level as UC1/UC2, with failure/retry rules in a concise unboxed footer. Authenticated Employee loads/selects an item and submits. Existing PrepareStockReceipt encapsulates item/quantity checks, original StockReceipt creation/validation and server request-key context. Only preparation success enters the shown new-submission registration. Same-submission retry is alternate handling explained in the footer: it skips preparation and preserves requestKey/item/quantity/receivedAt. Existing RecordSouvenirStockReceipt authenticates and normally checks FindStockReceiptByRequestKey before saving. Found results are mapped to receipt: StockReceipt and checked with MatchesRequest; true confirms existing receipt without another save, false is request conflict. Normal absence requires matching prepared server context before the shown ValidateReceipt; missing/mismatched context ends without saving. Only passed receipt validation and existing current item reach SaveStockReceipt. The receipt collaboration role denotes the stored object or original prepared object in mutually exclusive alternatives; there is no assertion that both are the same runtime object or a new shared member. Only confirmed commit or matched stored receipt reloads current stock. A common StockReceiptResponse carries all existing logical outcomes; conflict and validation failures skip saving/refresh and do not fabricate receipt/stock. Storage rollback/unknown, same-key recovery and refresh failure are encapsulated by the existing API and explained in the footer. Missing/failed stock refresh keeps verified receipt success and stockRefreshSucceeded=false; normal latest stock fills currentSouvenir and true. The UI calls currentSouvenir.GetStockQuantity only under the already defined response Boolean. No extra retry/context/error frames, new method, class field, result code or separate use-case sequence is introduced. Repository forwarding is encapsulated, all copied class definitions/signatures remain unchanged, and UI-to-actor completion is unnamed."
								}
							],
