									"sequenceNumber": "10",
									"documentation": "Shown main trace is a new submission. Existing API checks Employee/item/quantity, builds/validates the original receipt and preserves requestKey/receivedAt server context. A same-submission retry skips this preparation and reuses the original context, as specified in the footer.",
