										"$ref": "MWT_UC8_298e8f8f837f4391a7b3beaeb3319810"
									},
									"sequenceNumber": "28",
									"documentation": "Complete the existing UI operation after displaying the existing response or preparation error; UI return remains unnamed.",
									"messageSort": "reply"
								}
							],
							"fragments": [
								{
									"_type": "UMLCombinedFragment",
									"_id": "MWT_UC8_fbe82a210c5d470fba0ce16a6ec05692",
									"_parent": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC8_20188379625546c3b9ec1110b3665100"
									},
									"interactionOperator": "opt",
									"documentation": "Only normal non-null registered-item data permits saving. Missing item and query error skip saving and produce the existing failure response.",
									"operands": [
										{
											"_type": "UMLInteractionOperand",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_e2d3ccc43fdb4ad4861196f70dd5c9a3",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_fbe82a210c5d470fba0ce16a6ec05692"
											},
											"guard": "FindSouvenir returned normally with a value"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"_type": "UMLCombinedFragment",
									"_id": "MWT_UC8_12e9ce64e5d44d469ebf1981787bea3f",
									"_parent": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC8_20188379625546c3b9ec1110b3665100"
									},
									"interactionOperator": "opt",
									"documentation": "The immediately preceding ValidateReceipt result determines proceeding. Failure skips item recheck/saving and returns the existing input-error response below; no concrete validity field is invented.",
									"operands": [
										{
											"_type": "UMLInteractionOperand",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_707212a89ba24b2780f79dbe26353ba6",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_12e9ce64e5d44d469ebf1981787bea3f"
											},
											"guard": "Receipt validation passed"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"_type": "UMLCombinedFragment",
									"_id": "MWT_UC8_8e09a55e661c4f01b3167575f6cf2c1e",
									"_parent": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC8_20188379625546c3b9ec1110b3665100"
									},
									"interactionOperator": "alt",
									"documentation": "These conditions apply only to a normal lookup return. Found records are checked without another save; absence permits a new save only after internal server-context checks and validation. The same receipt: StockReceipt collaboration role is bound to the stored object in the found branch or original prepared object in the new branch; no separate shared class field or identity between those objects is asserted.",
									"operands": [
										{
											"_type": "UMLInteractionOperand",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_26bdd9fa8d6e49d7af56ad1afb21a5b7",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_8e09a55e661c4f01b3167575f6cf2c1e"
											},
											"guard": "stockReceiptResult != null"
										},
										{
											"_type": "UMLInteractionOperand",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_9e98f2a1784f4fb294e6101d85e0be43",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_8e09a55e661c4f01b3167575f6cf2c1e"
											},
											"guard": "stockReceiptResult = null"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"_type": "UMLCombinedFragment",
									"_id": "MWT_UC8_5b6ccf96fc0a4281af1b9cdc9e1aa979",
									"_parent": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC8_20188379625546c3b9ec1110b3665100"
									},
									"interactionOperator": "opt",
									"documentation": "Only confirmed save or verified matching existing receipt permits current-stock refresh. Request mismatch, receipt/context/item validation failure or unknown outcome skips this operand and returns the corresponding existing response. Same-key recovery of unknown storage is described in the footer and also requires MatchesRequest.",
									"operands": [
										{
											"_type": "UMLInteractionOperand",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_3f4c307814704b6db3e4d74e016eecfb",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_5b6ccf96fc0a4281af1b9cdc9e1aa979"
											},
											"guard": "Save committed or (existing receipt found and requestMatches = true)"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"_type": "UMLCombinedFragment",
									"_id": "MWT_UC8_46c77c991b2249ffa433f0b820e43c3d",
									"_parent": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC8_20188379625546c3b9ec1110b3665100"
									},
									"interactionOperator": "opt",
									"documentation": "The already defined response field controls updating current stock. False retains confirmed receipt success where applicable and requests stock reload; failed registration remains failed.",
									"operands": [
										{
											"_type": "UMLInteractionOperand",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_421e215930014e139c89fa6bb551eef3",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_46c77c991b2249ffa433f0b820e43c3d"
											},
											"guard": "stockRefreshSucceeded = true"
										}
									]
								},
								{
									"_type": "UMLCombinedFragment",
									"_id": "MWT_UC8_541524d6fd984ee0943eebda52b5d0ad",
									"_parent": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC8_20188379625546c3b9ec1110b3665100"
									},
									"interactionOperator": "opt",
									"documentation": "The shown main trace is a new submission. Failed preparation skips RecordSouvenirStockReceipt and displays the existing preparation guidance. Same-submission retries are alternate handling described in the footer, reuse the same key/input and do not rerun PrepareStockReceipt; this guard is not a newly added Boolean field.",
									"operands": [
										{
											"_type": "UMLInteractionOperand",
											"_id": "MWT_UC8_3ca63e92397d4fbe989bdd7280578c83",
											"_parent": {
												"$ref": "MWT_UC8_541524d6fd984ee0943eebda52b5d0ad"
											},
											"guard": "Preparation succeeded"
										}
									]
								}
							],
							"documentation": "UC8 main new-submission flow at the same overview level as UC1/UC2, with failure/retry rules in a concise unboxed footer. Authenticated Employee loads/selects an item and submits. Existing PrepareStockReceipt encapsulates item/quantity checks, original StockReceipt creation/validation and server request-key context. Only preparation success enters the shown new-submission registration. Same-submission retry is alternate handling explained in the footer: it skips preparation and preserves requestKey/item/quantity/receivedAt. Existing RecordSouvenirStockReceipt authenticates and normally checks FindStockReceiptByRequestKey before saving. Found results are mapped to receipt: StockReceipt and checked with MatchesRequest; true confirms existing receipt without another save, false is request conflict. Normal absence requires matching prepared server context before the shown ValidateReceipt; missing/mismatched context ends without saving. Only passed receipt validation and existing current item reach SaveStockReceipt. The receipt collaboration role denotes the stored object or original prepared object in mutually exclusive alternatives; there is no assertion that both are the same runtime object or a new shared member. Only confirmed commit or matched stored receipt reloads current stock. A common StockReceiptResponse carries all existing logical outcomes; conflict and validation failures skip saving/refresh and do not fabricate receipt/stock. Storage rollback/unknown, same-key recovery and refresh failure are encapsulated by the existing API and explained in the footer. Missing/failed stock refresh keeps verified receipt success and stockRefreshSucceeded=false; normal latest stock fills currentSouvenir and true. The UI calls currentSouvenir.GetStockQuantity only under the already defined response Boolean. No extra retry/context/error frames, new method, class field, result code or separate use-case sequence is introduced. Repository forwarding is encapsulated, all copied class definitions/signatures remain unchanged, and UI-to-actor completion is unnamed."
						}
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
